{"id":"8dff12feb21a4910b5daedae32d360247138d7b5","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230899","title":"DeepSeek 4 正式版是不是鸽了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"aimuz","excerpt":"DeepSeek - @aimuz - 7 月都快过完了，说好的 DeepSeek V4 正式版到现在还没影。隔壁 Kimi K3 都已经开放权重了，这边连个准信都没有。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>7 月都快过完了，说好的 DeepSeek V4 正式版到现在还没影。隔壁 Kimi K3 都已经开放权重了，这边连个准信都没有。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919251\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a087/1963/186098_normal.png?m=1646968527\" alt=\"xooass\" data-uid=\"186098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xooass\">xooass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 09:54:38 +08:00\">22h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>小梁在忙着 AGI 呢</p><p>最近全是这种新闻</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919297\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/83d2/802a/354938_normal.png?m=1784085605\" alt=\"weixind\" data-uid=\"354938\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/weixind\">weixind</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 09:59:44 +08:00\">22h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>被 K3 截胡了吧。</p><p>k3 看上去已经顶到 openAI 和 A➗的屁眼子。</p><p>如果 V4 正式版没 K3 强其实没必要发，可能回炉重造了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919310\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/59295e4931fa889e129044193ed6f2d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ynkkdev\" data-uid=\"365649\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ynkkdev\">ynkkdev</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:01:19 +08:00\">22h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/weixind\">weixind</a> 是感觉被架住了，发的 v4 预览版当时也做不到国内第一，发个一般般的模型出来确实还不如不发了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/278e/c49c/665020_normal.png?m=1701249818\" alt=\"SilentOrFight\" data-uid=\"665020\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SilentOrFight\">SilentOrFight</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:11:55 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/weixind\">weixind</a> #2 deepseek 从来都不是最强的，他的优势是部署低成本，能以很低的成本达到第一梯队模型的 80%的效果（数字不确定，反正是这个意思）？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919521\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8551/d9b2/235976_normal.png?m=1780048384\" alt=\"aimuz\" data-uid=\"235976\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aimuz\">aimuz</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:25:39 +08:00\">22h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果能比 glm2.5 强，保持价格不变。这个还是很有竞争力的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919649\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b31d/7645/536249_normal.png?m=1711436800\" alt=\"jackerbauer\" data-uid=\"536249\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackerbauer\">jackerbauer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:40:29 +08:00\">22h 0m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>关键是，连一个说明都不发，自己说的话，就这么咽下去了，还不解释一下。<br>不太喜欢这个公司这样的做事习惯。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919676\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7e2bf922cd1549f93c11c5c00158eb57?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Yadomin\" data-uid=\"497842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yadomin\">Yadomin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:44:05 +08:00\">21h 57m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 5</span>\n                    \n                    <p>梁宫春日：漫无止境的七月</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919844\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/29ba/840f/418082_normal.png?m=1752116658\" alt=\"myqonnt\" data-uid=\"418082\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/myqonnt\">myqonnt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:06:58 +08:00\">21h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道为啥都这么关注 DeepSeek ？ 它也不是以能力强出名的吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919891\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6be/bbe3/32362_normal.png?m=1720085134\" alt=\"46fo\" data-uid=\"32362\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/46fo\">46fo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:12:29 +08:00\">21h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉像是 能力的提升匹配不上价格 所以就不想发了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919902\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f352/8906/309227_normal.png?m=1780325220\" alt=\"la9998372\" data-uid=\"309227\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/la9998372\">la9998372</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:13:58 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>估计是跑分没有比过 K3 ，可能需要重新打造了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919925\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b989/ed4a/91590_normal.png?m=1776430252\" alt=\"fang2hou\" data-uid=\"91590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fang2hou\">fang2hou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:17:38 +08:00\">21h 23m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内模型都挺喜欢留一手狙击友商，抢点流量，qwen 这次看上去就是想狙击 k3 热度结果没啥声量。<br>ds4 要是没 k3 强出来说实话也没意思，而且会有种最新模型不如人的感觉，还不如再回炉一下</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5f76/7779/76329_normal.png?m=1711676102\" alt=\"xiaoz\" data-uid=\"76329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoz\">xiaoz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:29:34 +08:00\">21h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>DS 官方不会说的事农历的 7 月中旬吧，哈哈。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919997\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5f76/7779/76329_normal.png?m=1711676102\" alt=\"xiaoz\" data-uid=\"76329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoz\">xiaoz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:29:57 +08:00\">21h 11m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/aimuz\">aimuz</a> #8 ，是 GLM 5.2 吧，不是 2.5</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920092\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:46:30 +08:00\">20h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果传言是真的，agent 与正式版一起发布，agent 在内测的话，下个月应该能使用了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920101\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d13/d901/9561_normal.png?m=1742733384\" alt=\"mewking\" data-uid=\"9561\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mewking\">mewking</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 11:48:50 +08:00\">20h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/weixind\">weixind</a> 希望接下来顶屁眼子顶的再狠点，但是 V4 总参数和激活参数比 K3 差好多，难顶……</p><p>GLM 5 系参数规模更小</p><p>Gemini 也赶紧来一起顶屁眼子啊</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920183\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6b3/7360/22839_normal.png?m=1702881883\" alt=\"jimrok\" data-uid=\"22839\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jimrok\">jimrok</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 12:12:05 +08:00\">20h 29m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>你们这么关注主要还是 1.便宜，不但便宜，还不限购。2. 能力还行，能提升一下就赚大了。又便宜又好用，还要什么自行车。3. 梁圣对性能要求还是有的，不浮夸。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920189\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9d2d/9f71/212541_normal.png?m=1777002230\" alt=\"dingawm\" data-uid=\"212541\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dingawm\">dingawm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 12:14:32 +08:00\">20h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/myqonnt\">myqonnt</a> #15 便宜啊，现在 K3 这么贵，即使有官方订阅，还是不便宜，更不用说 API 了。外国都很多用 DeepSeek 的，不过很多不是用来 Coding 就是了。<br>@<a href=\"/member/jackerbauer\">jackerbauer</a> #11 这个确实，感觉 DeepSeek 不太喜欢发声，之前被那个华为天才少年碰瓷的时候也没发声。</p><p>听说最近在内测他们自己的 Harness 了，不知道真假</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920294\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3d3/8d4b/308276_normal.png?m=1664944247\" alt=\"jaoyina\" data-uid=\"308276\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jaoyina\">jaoyina</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 12:51:45 +08:00\">19h 49m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>不发也有好处，至少不会涨价了吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920418\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5d51756303e9a5222f04f031f6a135d4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"momowei\" data-uid=\"80631\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/momowei\">momowei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 13:33:54 +08:00\">19h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>d4 正式版要是有 gpt5.5 的水平，现在的价格，那真的杀疯了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920646\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/096e4a7dd94423358c6d4aa94a8bd70f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Rickkkkkkk\" data-uid=\"287234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rickkkkkkk\">Rickkkkkkk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 14:14:28 +08:00\">18h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不能有助于通往 AGI 的事情并不值得投入精力。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17920838\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/87b3895e059479462da8fa071e2b5739?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kirbyzhu\" data-uid=\"305092\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kirbyzhu\">kirbyzhu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 14:50:12 +08:00\">17h 50m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds 只能做一些辅助工作 用来编程还是拉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921047\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ea7362de93a477f9b7caf113aa560e8b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"micean\" data-uid=\"182026\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/micean\">micean</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 15:24:35 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说是等他们自己的 harness 一起上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921603\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efe3e3240b4e0011ca8376aee28af199?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cvbnt\" data-uid=\"100968\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvbnt\">cvbnt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 17:02:23 +08:00\">15h 38m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>七月中旬是牢梁的谎言</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921846\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2fe184b44a4676ec58234b93386e44a1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"moguiyu\" data-uid=\"134117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/moguiyu\">moguiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 17:36:43 +08:00\">15h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前说的是“计划”，不是一定。计划总是会变的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17922427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51e3/2018/587946_normal.png?m=1765261641\" alt=\"junan\" data-uid=\"587946\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/junan\">junan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 21:31:53 +08:00\">11h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>众所周知，农历七月也是七月</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"7 月都快过完了，说好的 DeepSeek V4 正式版到现在还没影。隔壁 Kimi K3 都已经开放权重了，这边连个准信都没有。 1 xooass 22h 46m ago 小梁在忙着 AGI 呢最近全是这种新闻 2 weixind 22h 41m ago 被 K3 截胡了吧。k3 看上去已经顶到 openAI 和 A➗的屁眼子。如果 V4 正式版没 K3 强其实没必要发，可能回炉重造了。 4 ynkkdev 22h 39m ago @weixind 是感觉被架住了，发的 v4 预览版当时也做不到国内第一，发个一般般的模型出来确实还不如不发了 6 SilentOrFight 22h 29m ago 1 @weixind #2 deepseek 从来都不是最强的，他的优势是部署低成本，能以很低的成本达到第一梯队模型的 80%的效果（数字不确定，反正是这个意思）？ 8 aimuz OP 22h 15m ago 如果能比 glm2.5 强，保持价格不变。这个还是很有竞争力的 11 jackerbauer 22h 0m ago 3 关键是，连一个说明都不发，自己说的话，就这么咽下去了，还不解释一下。不太喜欢这个公司这样的做事习惯。 15 Yadomin 21h 57m ago 5 梁宫春日：漫无止境的七月 16 myqonnt 21h 34m ago 不知道为啥都这么关注 DeepSeek ？ 它也不是以能力强出名的吧。 17 46fo 21h 28m ago 感觉像是 能力的提升匹配不上价格 所以就不想发了 18 la9998372 21h 27m ago 估